                    },
                    "message": "Here\u2019s some additional info for the review. \nAfter applying this change, the EntityManager creates the following valve-related inventory objects:\n\n```\nroot@bmc:~# busctl tree xyz.openbmc_project.EntityManager | grep -i valve\n        \u2502 \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Ventura2_SCM/ReturnValve_1\n        \u2502 \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Ventura2_SCM/ReturnValve_2\n        \u2502 \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Ventura2_SCM/ReturnValve_3\n        \u2502 \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Ventura2_SCM/SupplyValve2_1\n        \u2502 \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Ventura2_SCM/SupplyValve2_2\n        \u2502 \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Ventura2_SCM/SupplyValve2_3\n        \u2502 \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Ventura2_SCM/SupplyValve_1\n        \u2502 \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Ventura2_SCM/SupplyValve_2\n        \u2502 \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Ventura2_SCM/SupplyValve_3\n        \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cable/ReturnValve_1_Port\n        \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cable/ReturnValve_2_Port\n        \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cable/ReturnValve_3_Port\n        \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cable/SupplyValve2_1_Port\n        \u2502 \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cable/SupplyValve2_2_Port\n        \u2502 \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/cable/SupplyValve2_3_Port\n        \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/valve\n          \u251c\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/valve/ReturnValve_1\n          \u2502 \u2514\u2500 /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/sys